- The original project's CNC cutting process is done using a snapmaker 3in1.
- The design tolerances are decided considering that the 1 mm flat end mill will be used.
- Safety glasses  must be put on during the CNC cutting process.
- The origin point should be set to the middle of the wood plate.
- The wood thickness should be measured and entered to the thickness parameter if dfx files are not going to be used.
